msgctxt "76"
msgid "Great work, Kiryu-san. I'll take it from here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Kiryu-san, you did it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "You've caught all the Reapers we know about in Downtown Ryukyu!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "I see. That's a relief then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Well, actually, I just got a call from Ibuki..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "He said they got some information on Shinzaki, the scout for the Reapers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "What? They did?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Yes, sir, and Ibuki-san needs your help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"We've finally got a chance to uncover who's behind all this. Would you be "
"willing to help out on this one?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Yeah, let's do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Please accept this as a token of our deep appreciation for all you've done "
"for us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "You got <Color:8>220,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "We're counting on you, Kiryu-san. Take care."
msgstr ""

